<title>MALAYSIA: BLeisure, Pantai suspended.</title>
<headline>BLeisure, Pantai suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Berjaya Leisure Bhd and Hospital Pantai Bhd were suspended on Friday pending announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Stock of Berjaya Leisure, a hotel and resort operator, closed at 6.95 ringgit on Thursday. Shares of hospital operator Hospital Pantai were last traded at 13.40 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
